      de: ["The highest point is the forested Minčol peak reaching 1394 meters in elevation", "Geologically composed of soft, folded flysch layers of sandstone and claystone", "Home to the expansive and highly popular Kubínska hoľa winter ski resort", "The mountain ridges are almost entirely blanketed by deep, dark spruce forests", "The spectacular Orava Castle (Oravský hrad) is situated on its northern foothills", "The main ridges offer sweeping panoramic views of the Western Tatras and Little Fatra", "Historically and geographically separates the Lower Orava and Upper Orava regions"],
